  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Pyramid County (1)** (2 reviews): Pyramid County segues directly into Little Maggie; Pyramid County includes a tease of Playin' in the Band [3][4]\n- **Down in the Valley to Pray** (1 review, 1 other source): The taper didn't expect an encore, so the solo song's first couple of seconds are missing from the recording; Billy performs this closing song solo [1][4]\n- **Little Maggie** (1 review): Reviewer hears an instrumental leading into Little Maggie [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hold That Woodpile Down**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Thirst Multilator**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **Pyramid County (1)**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n- **Down in the Valley to Pray**: rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BS2017-07-15.bs2017-07-15flac16mg21** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 60 min; rated 4.75/5 by 4 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The crowd kept demanding one more song until Billy came back for an encore [2]\n- Reviewer ranks this among the best of many sets at the fifth Red Wing Roots festival [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BS2017-07-15.bs2017-07-15flac16mg21**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech gefell sms 2000 > mg20(cards) > P2 [1]. Also: Windscreens were borrowed from Taper Jeff and shock mounts came from Gray [1]",
